ement you love with custom maps and a massive community. Whether you're here to swing through the trees or hang out with our awesome staff and players, there\u2019s always something happening.\n\nHighlights:\n\nElite Community: Join a thriving world with active staff and friendly players.\n\nFresh Backend: A brand-new version built for smoother gameplay and better performance.\n\nAction-Packed: Explore unique maps designed to test your agility and speed.\n\nMaster the movement. Join the community. Download Terra Tag now!", "short_description": "Terra tag Reborn (TTG) is a fun gtag copy with mods and good staff\nJOIN UP!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/terratagpolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RVXGT", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/terratagofficial/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25090590210639628"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293669_2017423629186417_8501822845385598292_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vfOGjdyGIoUQ7kNvwHu3rSA&_nc_oc=AdrMogCb1hRh7KEU5HMaZLdQzUZTIOH3gaMEebqH7t4Y51ObFD5dpdBg9FP1FCFK7qU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1